            "gemstone_name": "garnet",
            "description": "<p>Birthstone Overview</p><p>Garnet, January’s birthstone, is one of the most diverse gemstones, as it comes in an extraordinary range of colors. The garnet birthstone is mined around the world and symbolizes many different positive emotions. Learn more about this unique birthstone.<a href=\"https://www.gia.edu/birthstones#gem-4\"><br/><br/></a></p>"
