        "month_Uc8KLx": {
          "type": "month",
          "settings": {
            "month_name": "February",
            "gemstone_image": "shopify://shop_images/February-Amethyst-Small.png",
            "gemstone_name": "amethyst",
            "description": "<p>Birthstone Overview</p><p>Amethyst, the February birthstone, is the purple variety of quartz and is said to cure drunkenness and make you quick-witted in business. You once had to be rich to own this birthstone for February, but new finds have made it more affordable. Learn more about this stunning birthstone and where it can be found.</p>"
