            "gemstone_image": "shopify://shop_images/May-Emerald-Small.png",
            "gemstone_name": "emerald",
            "description": "<p>Birthstone Overview</p><p>Emerald is the May birthstone – and it’s a perfect choice. Its enchanting greens mirror the splendor of spring. Few places on earth have the geological conditions needed to produce the coveted May birthstone. Learn about the history of emeralds and the exotic locations where emeralds can be fo</p>"
          }
        },
