            "gemstone_name": "pearl, alexandrite and moonstone",
            "description": "<p>Birthstone Overview</p><p>Pearl, alexandrite and moonstone are the three birthstones for June. Learn about their history and where these three June birthstones can be found, so that you can buy the perfect June birthstone for yourself or a loved one</p>"
          }
        },
        "month_79UHdW": {
